resume_parser.markdown:
# Resume

Product manager / Business analyst
Years of experience: 3
English level: upper

- Growth from startup to stable product;

- Very first international client (USA)
Product manager / Business analyst 

B2B SaaS product



Main responsibilities:



- Design the product development roadmap for both mobile app (Android and iOS) and web version;

- Business process mapping. Description of business processes;

- Requirement gathering, analysis, prioritisation and assessment;

- Creating requirements specifications, such as use cases, user story, flow diagrams, data mappings, business processes, technical requirements. Pushing to GitHub;

- Release. Planning and scheduling of releases, scrum meetings, backlog, task prioritisation;

- Redmine administration. Multi-project management, trackers, task life cycle, task statuses;

- Demo presentation for internal employees and customers;

- Designing new modules and functions;

- Functional and user acceptance testing to ensure that all client requirements are incorporated into the design;

- Writing a user manuals, release notes;

- Participation in negotiations (current and potential clients);

- Writing articles about the product and retail, conducting webinars, and assisting in creating marketing content about the product.
Professional growth

English language practice

work-life balance

