Business analyst
Years of experience: 4
English level: upper

• Participation in implementation of Customer issue handling module, based on Oracle Siebel CRM as BA;

• Organization of SQL training sessions for key users;

• Creation of functional specifications for developments of corporate business applications for Marketing function to improve system functionality and business processes taking into consideration existing Global Templates;
