•key user training's - preparation of training materials, organization of training sessions, presentations.
I am looking for a job that can offer me a possibility to join  the ambitious team in IT sphere. For me it is easy to learn new and use it in my work. I am highly motivated and ready to get new experience and overcome new obstacles. For me, it is not difficult to communicate with people, to be responsible for important tasks and projects and to achieve goals. Ready to do my best for your company. Hobby - mobile devices, football and new technologies. Smart and witty.

